<title>JAPAN: BOXING-CERMANO RETAINS WBA JUNIOR-FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-CERMANO RETAINS WBA JUNIOR-FEATHERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Antonio Cermeno of Venezuela retained his World Boxing Association (WBA) junior-featherweight boxing title on Saturday when he knocked out Japanese challenger Yuichi Kasai in the 12th and final round at the Yokohama Arena.</p>
